摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"添加deepseek harness多模态能力插件","id":"gh:1334935893","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-multimodal","slug":"chenkezhen480/dsh-multimodal","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","generative-ai"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"添加deepseek harness多模态能力插件"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-multimodal"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Image recognition and image generation for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh-plugin`, a Cordis plugin)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**The plugin is just tools**: `image_recognize`, `image_generate`, and `vision_providers` call which"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ever external API models the deployer declares — vision via multimodal `chat/completions`; image gen"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"eration via OpenAI-compatible `images/generations` or the Aliyun DashScope native async-task protoco"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"l. **No model is bundled or defaulted** — a tool invoked without a configured model fails with a cle"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"ar, actionable error. It never guesses and never fails silently."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Demo"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Image recognition | Image generation |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **`image_recognize`** — analyze an image (local path / http(s) URL / data URI) through a configure"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"d vision model: describe, OCR, read charts/screenshots, review content, …\n- Local files are inlined "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"as base64 data URIs (25 MiB cap)\n- `prompt` (what to ask), `max_tokens` / `temperature`, per-call `p"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"rovider` selection\n- **`image_generate`** — generate or transform an image through a configured imag"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"e model, save it to disk, and return its file path plus a Web-renderable URL when the static server "},{"id":"p9s6","text":"is enabled\n- **Text-to-image**: OpenAI-compatible `images/generations` (prefers `b64_json`, falls ba"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"ck to URL download), or `protocol: dashscope-native` for the DashScope async task API (submit → poll"},{"id":"p9s8","text":" → download), needed when an OpenAI-compatible gateway exposes no image routes (some Aliyun deployme"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"nts)\n- **Image-to-image**: pass an `image` argument (source image) to generate from it (edit / varia"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"nt / style transfer). OpenAI-compatible endpoints use the `image` field; DashScope native uses `base"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"_image_url`\n- **Watermark-free by default**: OpenAI-compatible requests carry `watermark: false` (Do"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"ubao Seedream etc. support it; endpoints rejecting the param are retried without it). Set `watermark"},{"id":"p9s13","text":": true` on the provider to keep the vendor's mark\n- **Inline in the Web chat**: a built-in static se"},{"id":"p9s14","text":"rver (default 127.0.0.1:3081) exposes generated images as absolute http(s) URLs; the tool returns Ma"},{"id":"p9s15","text":"rkdown `![](url)` lines the model can paste into its reply so the GUI renders them (the GUI's Markdo"},{"id":"p9s16","text":"wn renderer allows only absolute http(s) image URLs — local paths, relative links and data URIs neve"},{"id":"p9s17","text":"r render; the harness webserver serves no arbitrary files, and writing into the frontend dist direct"},{"id":"p9s18","text":"ory does not work, tested)\n- **Real-format extensions**: base64 payloads get their extension from th"},{"id":"p9s19","text":"e magic bytes (PNG/JPEG/WebP/GIF) so Content-Type matches the content\n- `size` (e.g. `1024x1024`), `"},{"id":"p9s20","text":"n` (1–4, auto-suffixed filenames), `output_path` (directory or file)\n- Default save location: `<call"},{"id":"p9s21","text":"er workspace>/generated/`, timestamped filenames\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install into a DSH profile"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The DSH plugin command delegates installation to `pnpm`, so `pnpm` must be on\n`PATH` regardless of h"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ow DSH itself is launched. Build this local checkout\nbefore installing it (the package entry point i"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"aunched. Build this local checkout\nbefore installing it (the package entry point is `lib/index.js`):"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then use the command that matches how you run DSH:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The package also has a `prepare` lifecycle script so Git-hosted installs build\nbefore use. A local `"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"file:` checkout should still be built explicitly before\n`add`, which makes the required runtime arti"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"fact easy to verify."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Then restart the Web profile with the same launcher (`npx @deepseek-ai/dsh web`,\n`pnpm dsh web`, or "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"`dsh web`) and open a **new session** (tool sets are fixed\nper session). The in-package `cordis.patc"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"h.yml` is the deployment config source\n(in-package config overrides outer layers; `settings.yaml` an"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"d user profile\npatches only fill undeclared keys)."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"> **⚠️ Applying config changes (important)**: the web profile uses `nodeLinker: hoisted`, so a `file"},{"id":"p17s2","text":":` plugin is **copied** into the profile (not symlinked). After editing `cordis.patch.yml` you must "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"resync:\n> 1. Delete `<DSH_HOME>\\profiles\\web\\node_modules\\dsh-plugin-multimodal` (the snapshot dir)\n"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"> 2. Run `<your DSH launcher> plugin --profile web install`\n> 3. Restart the Web profile with the sa"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"me launcher\n>\n> Re-running `dsh plugin add` alone will **not** recopy existing content; deleting the"},{"id":"p17s6","text":" snapshot first is what makes `install` reliable."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 1. Configure external API models (required)"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Fill in `apiBase`, `apiKey`, and `model` in the `providers` list of the in-package `cordis.patch.yml"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"` (**none of these connection values has a working default**). The plugin and DSH Web still start wh"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ile they are empty; validation happens when the corresponding tool is called. The protocol is OpenAI"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"-compatible, so any vendor works:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"`id` must be unique; the same endpoint may host several models under different ids; vision and image"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" generation may point at different vendors. `image_generate` does **not** distinguish t2i/i2i: passi"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ng an `image` argument switches to `i2iModel` (or the same `model` when unset); omitting it means te"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"` argument switches to `i2iModel` (or the same `model` when unset); omitting it means text-to-image."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### 3. What the model can do"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Recognize** — *\"识别这张图 C:\\path\\to\\photo.png 里有什么\"* → `image_recognize`\n- **Text-to-image** — *\"画一"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"只戴帽子的橘猫，保存到 output 目录\"* → `image_generate` returns the saved file path\n- **Image-to-image** — *\"把这张图"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" https://.../a.png 里的猫变成蓝色（用 my-image-wanx）\"* → `image_generate` with `image` + `provider`\n- **Inspe"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ct** — *\"你现在能用哪些图像模型？\"* → `vision_providers`"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **25 MiB inline cap for local images** — compress or use a URL for larger files\n- **Generated-imag"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"e format detection** — PNG/JPEG/WebP/GIF base64 payloads use their detected extension; unknown base6"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"4 formats fall back to PNG, while downloaded URL results use the response Content-Type\n- **DashScope"},{"id":"p26s4","text":" image-to-image needs a public image URL** — `base_image_url` rejects local paths and data URIs (tes"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"ted). Upload the source image to a public location (Alibaba Cloud OSS / any image host) first and pa"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"ss the URL. Some models (e.g. `wanx2.1-imageedit`) are pickier about URLs — `wanx-v1` is the most re"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"liable for i2i (tested)\n- **Old sessions don't see new tools** — open a new session after install/up"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"grade\n- **Non-standard compatible endpoints** — the plugin retries once without `response_format`; i"},{"id":"p26s9","text":"f the endpoint still errors, the remote message is surfaced"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
